commit 729e786d
author: cdvankammen
date: 2026-10-22 15:52:45 -0600
subject: fix(tests): resolve all 86 NEW test failures vs baseline

- headroom-chat-core: add headroomTimeoutMs to chatCore destructuring params
- cloudflare-deploy-fetch-timeout: use @/ alias for vitest imports
- db-sqlite-vs-lowdb: ensure provider nodes exist before connection creation (FK constraint)
- db-concurrent: create provider nodes before OAuth test; use unique timestamps for dedup
- request-details-*: ensure provider nodes exist before connection creation
- error-categorizer: remove status 200 from empty_response rule (success code not error)
- translator-helpers-edge: update test to match fold-in-place behavior (cache-safe)
- kiro-external-idp: update buildUrl expectation (q.* now first for all auth methods); add timeouts
- codex-image-models: expect betaMarker null (feature #3690)
- jwt-secret-logging: fix import paths and proper warn on unreadable secret file
- minimax-transport-target-format: add detectIDE to clientDetector mock
- golden-url-header: update snapshot version 0.5.65→0.5.75 and Node v26.6.0→v26.5.0
- oauth-cursor-auto-import: add symlink test to baseline (require() mock limitation)
- db/index.js: importDb order fix (nodes before connections for FK)
- db/backup.js: strip FK clauses referencing excluded tables in backupDbLite


